# Execution order of round phase0-r1 for gemini/gemma-4-31b-it (one run per line: DEFENSE SCENARIO).
# Owner decision, 2026-11-12: paired order, so a daily-quota stop leaves both defenses on the
# same scenarios. For each scenario b01, b02, b03, a01..a10: `none` then `prompt`; the list
# repeats 3 times (the k-th appearance of a line is repeat k). Scenarios and judge are the same
# as for the other phase0-r1 models, which run in scripts/round.sh order.
none b01-coffee
prompt b01-coffee
none b02-long-receipt
prompt b02-long-receipt
none b03-inbox-bills
prompt b03-inbox-bills
